OL,3,GNEWSABBC weatherman announces he's
OL,4,Awalking away from role after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter nearly 30 years, BBC Wales'
OL,7,Fbest-known weather presenter is
OL,8,Fstepping away from the role, he has
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FDerek Brockway presented his first BBC
OL,12,FWales Today forecast in 1997 and went
OL,13,Fon to front the TV series Weatherman
OL,14,FWalking for nearly 20 years.
OL,16,FHe has covered the biggest weather
OL,17,Fevents to hit the country including the
OL,18,FBeast from the East, Storm Dennis and
OL,19,Fthis year's heatwave.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
